		2. Widget — inboundCallPop/dist/inboundCallPop.zip
		Upload it, then add it to your InboundCall page.
		
		🔴 Two things you must fill in
		a) The public key — widget.html, near the top:
		
		
		var API_PUBLIC_KEYS = {
		  getInboundCallerInfo: ""     // ← paste it here
		};
		Copy it from getInboundCallerInfo's Endpoint URL after you create the API. Without it every lookup fails with 9370 invalid public key — the exact error customerPage hit.
		
		b) Page Variables on InboundCall — declare phone (and optionally ucid, type) and map them to the widget, same as you did on Dashboard_2. The iframe can't read the parent URL; getQueryParams() is the only channel.
		
