		Field	Used in
		Base_Fee	Gross Fee = Base_Fee + KM Fee
		Base_KM	KM Fee is 0 while actual KM ≤ Base_KM
		KM_Rate	KM Fee = slabs × KM_Rate
		KM_Slab_Repair	slab size for RSR
		KM_Slab_Tow_2W_FBT	slab size, flatbed tow, 2-wheeler
		KM_Slab_Tow_4W_FBT	slab size, flatbed tow, 4-wheeler
		KM_Slab_Tow_2W_MT	slab size, manual tow, 2-wheeler
		KM_Slab_Tow_4W_MT	slab size, manual tow, 4-wheeler
		TDS_Percentage	Batch TDS = Σ Net Fee × TDS_Percentage ÷ 100
		Only one of the five KM_Slab_* fields is read per case — which one depends on Service_Type, the FBT/MT issue, and the vehicle's 2W/4W category.
		
		Everything else on Vendors_Report is read for identification or Zoho Books routing, not arithmetic: vendor_name, Email, Mobile_Number_01, Zoho_Books_Vendor_ID, Fleet_ID.
		
		
