		Two judgment calls worth knowing, both following precedent already in that file:
		
		Everything is measured over completed tickets, the same basis the existing revenue tiles use, so no two financial figures on the page can disagree about which tickets counted. A booking fee taken today against a job finishing next week isn't counted yet — otherwise Collected would exceed Billed for the period and Outstanding would go negative.
		Each fee stage uses its own settlement flag — booking fee on Payment_Status = "PAID", remaining fee on Payment_received = "Yes". Billed is Total_Service_Fee, the agreed price, not the sum of the two parts; those can differ when a fee is revised after the booking fee was taken.
